<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ doc_label }} {{ doc_no }}</title>
<style>
/* ===========================================================================
   云枢 审批单模板（PDF-05：审批轨迹时间轴 + 每级意见 + 签字位）
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
   结构：页眉（公司名 + 单据标题）→ 单据信息（类型 / 单号 / 金额 / 申请人 /
        申请时间 …）→ 审批结论横幅 → **审批轨迹表**（级次 / 节点 / 审批人 /
        结果 / 时间 / 意见 + 降级标记行）→ **各级签字位**（留空手写）→ 页脚。

   打印四条铁律（与订单 / 出入库 / 调拨模板同源）：
     ① @page 定死纸张与外边距；
     ② thead { display: table-header-group } —— 轨迹跨页时表头重复；
     ③ tr / .banner / .sign-block { break-inside: avoid } —— 不腰斩；
     ④ .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums } —— 金额时间等宽。

   页码（「第 X 页 / 共 Y 页」）由 CDP footerTemplate 输出
   （`pdf::template::approval_footer`），HTML 里刻意不放占位符。

   降级标记（ARCH-8 / P3-02~04）单独一行 `tr.tag-row`（colspan=6）：
   「已跳过（自审）」/「已升级至 XX（原角色无人）」/「兜底审批人」/「委托代批」。
   放独立行而不是塞进结果格，是为了让长文案不被 44pt 的结果列劈成三行。
   =========================================================================== */
@page {
  size: A4 portrait;
  margin: 12mm 10mm 16mm 10mm;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
  font-size: 10pt;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: #1f2329;
  word-break: break-word;
}

/* ---------- 页眉 ---------- */
.sheet-header {
  border-bottom: 1.5pt solid #1f2329;
  padding-bottom: 4pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
.sheet-header .company {
  font-size: 12.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 1pt;
}
.sheet-header .doc-title {
  font-size: 17pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 8pt;
  margin: 4pt 0 6pt;
}

/* ---------- 单据信息 ---------- */
table.head-fields {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9.5pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
}
table.head-fields td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #c9cdd4;
  padding: 3pt 5pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.head-fields td.label {
  width: 62pt;
  background: #f2f3f5;
  color: #4e5969;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.head-fields td.value { width: auto; }

/* ---------- 结论横幅 ---------- */
.banner {
  break-inside: avoid;
  page-break-inside: avoid;
  border: 0.8pt solid #1f2329;
  background: #f7f8fa;
  padding: 5pt 8pt;
  margin-bottom: 9pt;
  font-size: 10.5pt;
}
.banner .tag { font-weight: 700; color: #4e5969; }
.banner .verdict { font-weight: 700; font-size: 12pt; }
.banner .verdict.is-approve { color: #0f7b46; }
.banner .verdict.is-reject { color: #b3261e; }
.banner .verdict.is-pending { color: #1f5fbf; }
.banner .verdict.is-void { color: #4e5969; }
.banner .note { font-size: 9pt; color: #4e5969; margin-top: 2pt; }

/* ---------- 区块小标题 ---------- */
.section-title {
  font-size: 10.5pt;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 10pt 0 4pt;
  padding-left: 4pt;
  border-left: 3pt solid #1f2329;
}

/* ---------- 审批轨迹 ---------- */
table.trace {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
  table-layout: fixed;
}
table.trace thead { display: table-header-group; }
table.trace th,
table.trace td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 2.6pt 4pt;
  vertical-align: top;
}
table.trace th {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.trace tr { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
/* 列宽：级次 40pt / 节点 74pt / 审批人 80pt / 结果 40pt / 时间 70pt / 意见 auto
   （审批人 80pt：姓名 + 「部门经理」这类长名在 62pt 会折成 4 行，视觉上比节点名还高） */
.c-level { width: 40pt; text-align: center; }
.c-node  { width: 74pt; }
.c-who   { width: 80pt; }
.c-result{ width: 40pt; text-align: center; }
.c-at    { width: 70pt; }
.c-opinion{ width: auto; }

.c-level .level { font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
.c-level .round { display: block; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #86909c; white-space: nowrap; }
.c-at { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 8.5pt; }
.c-result .verdict { font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
.c-result .verdict.is-approve { color: #0f7b46; }
.c-result .verdict.is-reject { color: #b3261e; }
.c-result .verdict.is-skip { color: #4e5969; }
.c-result .verdict.is-pending { color: #1f5fbf; }
.c-opinion { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.c-opinion .auto-tag { color: #86909c; font-size: 8pt; }

/* 降级标记行（ARCH-8）：整行浅橙底 + 左侧色条 */
table.trace tr.tag-row td {
  background: #fff7e8;
  border-top: 0;
  border-left: 2.5pt solid #d46b08;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
  color: #8a4b00;
  padding: 2.2pt 6pt;
}
table.trace tr.tag-row.is-skip td { border-left-color: #86909c; color: #4e5969; background: #f7f8fa; }
table.trace tr.tag-row.is-escalate td { border-left-color: #d46b08; }
table.trace tr.tag-row.is-fallback td { border-left-color: #b3261e; color: #8c1d18; background: #fff1f0; }
table.trace tr.tag-row.is-delegate td { border-left-color: #1f5fbf; color: #1f3f7a; background: #f0f5ff; }

.trace-empty {
  border: 0.5pt dashed #c9cdd4;
  padding: 10pt;
  text-align: center;
  color: #86909c;
  font-size: 9pt;
}

/* ---------- 签字位（留空手写） ---------- */
table.sign-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 9pt;
  margin-top: 4pt;
}
table.sign-table thead { display: table-header-group; }
table.sign-table th,
table.sign-table td {
  border: 0.5pt solid #86909c;
  padding: 3pt 4pt;
  vertical-align: middle;
}
table.sign-table th {
  background: #f2f3f5;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
table.sign-table tr { break-inside: avoid; page-break-inside: avoid; }
table.sign-table td.blank { height: 26pt; }
.sign-hint {
  margin-top: 3pt;
  font-size: 8pt;
  color: #86909c;
}

/* ---------- 说明 / 页脚 ---------- */
.remark {
  margin-top: 9pt;
  font-size: 8.8pt;
  color: #4e5969;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.remark .tag { font-weight: 700; color: #1f2329; }

.footnote {
  margin-top: 5pt;
  font-size: 7.5pt;
  color: #86909c;
  text-align: right;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet-header">
  <div class="company">{{ company }}</div>
  <div class="doc-title">{{ doc_title }}</div>
</div>

<table class="head-fields">
{% for row in meta_rows %}
  <tr>
{% for field in row %}
    <td class="label">{{ field.label }}</td>
    <td class="value">{{ field.value }}</td>
{% endfor %}
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>

<div class="banner">
  <span class="tag">审批结论：</span><span class="verdict {{ status_kind }}">{{ status }}</span>
{% if result_comment %}
  <span class="note">（{{ result_comment }}）</span>
{% endif %}
</div>

<div class="section-title">审批轨迹（共 {{ degree_count }} 级／{{ trace_count }} 条记录）</div>
{% if traces %}
<table class="trace">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th class="c-level">级次</th>
      <th class="c-node">节点</th>
      <th class="c-who">审批人</th>
      <th class="c-result">结果</th>
      <th class="c-at">时间</th>
      <th class="c-opinion">意见</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{% for trace in traces %}
    <tr class="trace-row">
      <td class="c-level"><span class="level">{{ trace.level }}</span>{% if trace.round_note %}<span class="round">{{ trace.round_note }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
      <td class="c-node">{{ trace.node_name }}</td>
      <td class="c-who">{{ trace.approver }}</td>
      <td class="c-result"><span class="verdict {{ trace.cls }}">{{ trace.result }}</span></td>
      <td class="c-at">{{ trace.at }}</td>
      <td class="c-opinion">{{ trace.opinion }}{% if trace.auto_note %} <span class="auto-tag">{{ trace.auto_note }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
    </tr>
{% if trace.tag %}
    <tr class="tag-row {{ trace.tag_kind }}">
      <td colspan="6">⚠ {{ trace.tag }}</td>
    </tr>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
{% else %}
<div class="trace-empty">暂无审批记录（本单尚未生成任何审批待办）</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="section-title">审批人签字</div>
{% if sign_slots %}
<table class="sign-table">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width:46pt">级次</th>
      <th style="width:100pt">节点</th>
      <th style="width:110pt">审批人</th>
      <th>签名（留空手写）</th>
      <th style="width:96pt">日期</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
{% for slot in sign_slots %}
    <tr>
      <td class="c-level">{{ slot.level }}</td>
      <td>{{ slot.node_name }}</td>
      <td>{{ slot.approver }}</td>
      <td class="blank"></td>
      <td class="blank"></td>
    </tr>
{% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
<div class="sign-hint">签名栏与日期栏一律留空，由各级审批人在纸质件上现场手写签名（打印件不作电子签名效力）。</div>
{% else %}
<div class="trace-empty">本单没有审批节点，无需签字。</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="remark"><span class="tag">说明：</span>本表轨迹按「退回轮次 → 落待办时间」排序，逐条对应系统内的审批留痕（含自审跳过 / 升级 / 兜底 / 委托记录），未做任何删减或合并。</div>

<div class="footnote">打印时间：{{ printed_at }}　本单据由云枢系统生成（{{ engine }}）</div>
</body>
</html>
